OL,3,GNEWSAI met the love of my life on
OL,4,ARoblox, now we're getting married
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Jacob Smith logged on to online
OL,7,Fgaming platform Roblox at 04:00, he had
OL,8,Fno idea he was about to meet the love
OL,9,Fof his life.
OL,11,FIn the small hours, the gaming fan,
OL,12,Ffrom Swadlincote in Derbyshire, joined
OL,13,Fa "random" Australian server on the
OL,14,Fplatform and was approached by fellow
OL,15,Fplayer Kiara Williams.
OL,17,FJacob, who started playing Roblox to be
OL,18,F"a bit more social" got more than he
OL,19,Fbargained for as the pair hit it off
OL,20,Fstraight away.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
