OL,3,GNEWSAI met the love of my life on
OL,4,ARoblox, now we're getting married
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the 11-hour time difference and
OL,7,Fdisrupted sleep schedules, the pair
OL,8,Fbonded over their love of gaming and
OL,9,Fthe couple finally met when Jacob took
OL,10,Fhis first ever flight to see her in
OL,11,FTasmania in 2025.
